{
  "address": "BNHMW9ZTzqRsRsKi9DUt8i5T4PFDFGRevPcHCQpvkuTu",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "hermes_auctions",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "spec": "0.1.0",
    "description": "Hermes auction bid escrow on Solana (USDC-only). Bidders escrow USDC per auction; the backend authority settles the winner and refunds the rest, with a trustless time-locked withdrawal as a safety valve."
  },
  "docs": [
    "Hermes Auctions — USDC bid escrow for an off-chain auction site.",
    "",
    "* Each bidder escrows USDC per auction in a `BidEscrow` PDA whose vault is",
    "the ATA of (payment_mint, escrow PDA). Repeat deposits accumulate.",
    "* The backend `authority` settles the winner (`settle`: amount →",
    "treasury, remainder → bidder) and refunds everyone else (`refund`).",
    "* If the backend disappears, any bidder can `withdraw_expired` once",
    "`auction.refund_after` has passed.",
    "* Closing an escrow always returns the escrow + vault rent to the bidder",
    "(who paid it on first deposit)."
  ],
